  ARRAY['Article discusses Chinese AI capabilities relative to restricted OpenAI and Anthropic models, with a Bitcoin industry warning. No physical security incident, violence, theft, or confirmed loss is reported.', 'Article discusses AI price predictions for XRP cryptocurrency; no physical security incident, threat, or attack reported.', NULL, 'Two individuals were sentenced in France following a home invasion where cryptocurrency ransom was demanded from victims.', 'A French couple in the Somme region experienced three separate home invasions after purchasing a property previously owned by a crypto millionaire, with attackers apparently targeting the wrong residence.', 'Singapore authorities issued a warning about bitcoin ransomware targeting the region; no specific physical security incidents, victims, or confirmed attacks are described.', 'Paraguayan authorities opened an investigation into the death of a Hong Kong-born cryptocurrency executive; no details regarding circumstances, cause, or confirmed connection to cryptocurrency holdings were provided in the excerpt.', NULL, 'Three Missouri men were charged in connection with a plot to rob a Danbury family of approximately $245 million in Bitcoin, representing an organized scheme targeting cryptocurrency holdings.', 'A Shenzhen employee was jailed for extorting approximately $87,000 in Bitcoin from a victim, with a court recognizing cryptocurrency as property in the case.', 'A Shenzhen employee was sentenced for attempting ransom involving cryptocurrency; no details provided regarding victim harm, amount demanded, or attack method.', 'Article discusses cryptocurrency investment performance and price trends for various digital assets from 2022-2026; no physical security incident reported.', 'A Bitcoin security review using AI identified 6,700 potential issues over 55 hours, but the article does not report any physical-world incident, attack, or confirmed harm.', 'Article discusses Bitcoin price recovery and market dynamics; no physical security incident, violence, theft, or cryptocurrency-related attack reported.', NULL, NULL, 'Physical coercion attacks targeting cryptocurrency holders exceeded $30 million in the first half of 2026, with France identified as a primary location for these incidents. The attacks involved threats or use of force to compel victims to transfer cryptocurrency assets.', 'Opinion article discussing closed-source security practices and referencing the Coldcard incident as an example of evolving security challenges; no specific physical incident, harm, or loss is described.', 'Crypto holders reportedly lost $30 million to wrench attacks (physical coercion for cryptocurrency access) in 2026, with France identified as a primary location for these incidents.', 'Chainalysis reports that crypto-related home invasions are increasing in frequency, with $30M stolen in 2026. France is identified as a primary location for these attacks, and perpetrators are employing sophisticated money laundering methods.', 'Chainalysis reports that more than $30 million was stolen in violent cryptocurrency attacks during 2026, with France identified as a hotspot for ''wrench attacks'' (physical coercion to extract crypto assets).', 'Chainalysis reports that more than $30 million was stolen in violent cryptocurrency attacks during 2026, with France identified as a hotspot for ''wrench attacks'' (physical coercion to extract crypto assets).', 'An ex-LAPD officer received a life sentence, and three men were charged in connection with a Bitcoin robbery, indicating an organized crime incident involving law enforcement corruption and cryptocurrency theft.', 'Federal authorities report that Missouri men conducted surveillance on a Connecticut family as part of a failed kidnapping plot motivated by cryptocurrency demands.', 'Three Missouri men were charged by federal prosecutors in connection with an alleged Bitcoin robbery plot; no details on victims, location, or harm were provided in the excerpt.', 'The White House is reviewing ethics text for the Crypto Clarity Act ahead of an August deadline, with senators preparing to vote on the legislation.', 'This article reports on Solana ETF trading flows and market activity, not a physical security incident or attack related to cryptocurrency.', 'A Bitcoin security research team identified 85 critical software vulnerabilities across 390 open-source repositories during a security audit, following a separate exploit of Coldcard hardware wallet firmware.', 'Two Missouri men face charges in an alleged home invasion plot targeting Bitcoin theft. The incident involves a planned physical attack on a residence to steal cryptocurrency.', 'Two St. Louis men were indicted for attempted robbery of a teenager connected to a $245 million Bitcoin theft; the excerpt provides no details on violence, injury, or success of the robbery attempt.', 'A cellular chipmaker sold 1,200 Bitcoin to eliminate convertible debt and increase cash reserves to $21 million, a corporate financial transaction with no physical security incident.', 'Three men were charged in connection with a failed bitcoin robbery linked to a cryptocurrency theft in the United States.', 'Three individuals in Missouri were charged in connection with an alleged kidnapping plot involving Bitcoin ransom demands.', 'Three men were charged in connection with a failed bitcoin robbery attempt linked to a cryptocurrency theft in the US.', 'Three men were charged in connection with a failed bitcoin robbery linked to a cryptocurrency theft in the United States.', 'Three Missouri men were charged in Connecticut for a violent carjacking and kidnapping incident motivated by cryptocurrency. The attack involved multiple perpetrators and victims in a coordinated criminal act.', 'A kidnapping scheme targeting a Bitcoin holder was attempted in Missouri in 2024 but failed. The incident involved a planned abduction of an individual for their cryptocurrency holdings.', 'Three Missouri men were charged in connection with a plot to rob Bitcoin, indicating a planned but not executed cryptocurrency theft scheme.', 'Three individuals from Missouri were charged with allegedly planning to travel to Connecticut to kidnap a Bitcoin holder and coerce cryptocurrency transfer, though the plan was abandoned before execution.', 'Three individuals in Missouri were charged in connection with an alleged kidnapping plot related to Bitcoin, though specific details about victims, harm, or amounts are not provided in the excerpt.', 'A former Los Angeles police officer received a life sentence for a $350,000 cryptocurrency robbery in Koreatown, involving an armed attack by a law enforcement officer against civilians.', NULL, 'Three Missouri men were charged in connection with a failed home invasion targeting Bitcoin holdings. The incident involved a physical attack on a residence, though the invasion was unsuccessful.', 'Three Missouri men pleaded not guilty to federal charges related to a Bitcoin robbery conspiracy in Connecticut, indicating an alleged coordinated attack on cryptocurrency holdings.', 'Three Missouri men were charged in connection with an alleged plot to steal bitcoin through home invasion, a planned violent crime targeting cryptocurrency assets.', 'Three additional individuals were charged in connection with a Connecticut kidnapping plot linked to cryptocurrency, with federal authorities citing a connection to $245 million.', 'Three Missouri men were charged with conspiracy to commit robbery targeting bitcoin through home invasion; they pleaded not guilty.', 'An ex-LAPD officer received a life sentence for a home invasion robbery targeting a teenager''s cryptocurrency holdings, representing an organized attack by a law enforcement insider with serious criminal intent.', 'Three additional individuals were charged in connection with a Connecticut kidnapping plot linked to cryptocurrency, with federal authorities citing a connection to $245 million.', 'Opinion article discussing hardware wallet security concerns following a Coldcard vulnerability, without reporting any physical incident, attack, or confirmed loss.']::text[]
