  ARRAY['Article discusses macroeconomic Treasury operations and their potential impact on Bitcoin market liquidity; no physical security incident or threat reported.', 'Article discusses Bitcoin price movement and regulatory developments in cryptocurrency markets; no physical security incident reported.', 'Two French cryptocurrency millionaires were kidnapped and tortured in London in an extortion plot demanding $30,000 in cryptocurrency.', 'Two French cryptocurrency millionaires were kidnapped and tortured in London as part of a $30,000 cryptocurrency extortion plot.', 'Five individuals were convicted of imprisoning cryptocurrency millionaires in London and subjecting them to torture. Two defendants were additionally convicted of conspiracy to blackmail in a case prosecuted without victim testimony.', NULL, NULL, 'Five individuals were convicted of imprisoning cryptocurrency millionaires in London and subjecting them to torture. The case involved kidnapping and coercion of victims with cryptocurrency wealth.', NULL, 'A family received ransom notes and sent bitcoin to a suspect in connection with Nancy Guthrie''s case, according to an ex-FBI agent''s statement. The incident involves kidnapping-related extortion with cryptocurrency payment.', 'An Italian bank adjusted its cryptocurrency derivatives positions, reducing Bitcoin ETF call options by 99% while increasing staked Ethereum holdings, according to regulatory filings.', 'A London court convicted six men in connection with the torture, burning, and extortion of French cryptocurrency millionaires, resulting in a forced payment of $30,000.', NULL, 'Five individuals were convicted in connection with a cryptocurrency-related kidnapping in London, indicating an organized crime incident involving abduction linked to digital assets.', 'Five individuals were convicted in connection with a cryptocurrency-related kidnapping in London, indicating a serious organized crime incident involving abduction linked to digital assets.', NULL, 'ZeroStack experienced a significant non-cash fair-value loss reducing its crypto holdings from $163M to $15M, but this represents a financial/accounting event rather than a physical security incident or attack.', 'Three individuals attempted to break into the home of a business owner holding cryptocurrency in Montigny-le-Bretonneux, Yvelines, France. No injuries or confirmed loss amounts are stated.', 'A ransom demand involving a Bitcoin wallet was made against Nancy Guthrie; the article discusses potential investigative leads from the wallet six months after the incident, with no stated harm, loss amount, or attack details provided.', 'The U.S. blacklisted an Iranian maritime scheme that allegedly coerced commercial ships to pay Bitcoin tolls for safe passage. No specific incidents of actual payment, violence, or confirmed losses are detailed in the excerpt.', 'Bitwise is liquidating six cryptocurrency option ETFs due to poor performance, with investors receiving cash redemptions in August. This is a financial/regulatory matter with no physical security incident.', 'Nancy Guthrie was kidnapped with a ransom demand involving Bitcoin; a Bitcoin expert suggests analyzing the ransom wallet could help identify the kidnappers.', 'Nancy Guthrie was kidnapped and a bitcoin ransom was demanded; six months later, the ransom transaction reportedly contains evidence relevant to the case.', 'Nancy Guthrie was kidnapped with a ransom demand involving Bitcoin; a Bitcoin expert suggests analyzing the ransom wallet could help identify the kidnappers.', 'Article discusses a cryptocurrency treasury transaction involving ETH collateral and asset reallocation; no physical security incident, violence, or confirmed loss reported.', 'Article discusses trading volume declines on cryptocurrency exchanges Bitstamp and Robinhood App between Q1 and Q2, with no physical security incident reported.', 'Article discusses US sanctions and regulatory actions against companies related to Iran''s cryptocurrency activities, with no reported physical security incidents, violence, or direct cryptocurrency theft.', 'Fraudsters impersonated a Chinese newspaper to demand Bitcoin from companies by threatening to publish investigative reports, according to the publication''s warning.', 'Russian FSB charged Pavel Durov with facilitating terrorism and issued an arrest warrant, causing GRAM token to decline 12% in value.', 'A flash crash on the Hyperliquid derivatives platform resulted in a $400M market decline in a South Korean trading market over 2 minutes, with open interest declining 20.29% while Trade.xyz investigated price inputs.', '52 wrench attacks targeting cryptocurrency holders occurred over six months, with the majority reported in France. Wrench attacks involve physical coercion to force victims to surrender cryptocurrency or access credentials.', 'Opinion article discussing Web3 startup closures and market conditions; no physical security incident or cryptocurrency-related attack reported.', NULL, '52 wrench attacks targeting cryptocurrency holders occurred over six months, with the majority reported in France. Wrench attacks involve physical coercion to force victims to surrender cryptocurrency or access credentials.', NULL, NULL, 'Article discusses Bitcoin market trading dynamics and options contracts; no physical security incident, violence, theft, or cryptocurrency loss reported.', 'A Brazilian agricultural technology initiative tokenized dairy cow data through IoT collars for financial market integration; no security incident, attack, or cryptocurrency theft reported.', 'A news report about Trump making a joke regarding a fourth term while TRUMP meme coin tokens moved to exchanges; no physical security incident or cryptocurrency theft reported.', 'CertiK Intel3D reports a 33% surge in physical cryptocurrency crimes (wrench attacks) during H1 2026, with estimated losses exceeding $124 million across multiple victims.', 'A ransom note in a kidnapping case demanded payment in bitcoin, but no confirmed loss, injury, or successful cryptocurrency transfer is stated in the excerpt.', 'Bitcoin price declined below $65,000 amid geopolitical tensions and rising oil prices; no physical cryptocurrency security incident reported.', 'A ransom note in a kidnapping case demanded millions in bitcoin as payment, but no details about victim harm, actual loss, or attack outcome are provided in the excerpt.', 'A ransom note in a kidnapping case demanded payment in bitcoin, but no details are provided regarding victim harm, actual loss, or attack outcome.', 'A ransom note in an unspecified kidnapping case demanded payment in bitcoin, but no confirmed loss, victim harm, or attack details are provided in the excerpt.', 'CertiK reported $124.1 million in recorded losses and ransom demands from cryptocurrency-related home invasions and wrench attacks in the first half of 2026, representing a significant increase in such incidents.', 'This article discusses political disagreements between Democrats and Republicans regarding ethics procedures and voting timelines. It contains no information about physical cryptocurrency security incidents, violence, theft, or attacks.', NULL, NULL, 'A ransom note in a kidnapping case demanded payment in bitcoin, but no details are provided regarding victim harm, actual loss, or attack outcome.']::text[]
