  ARRAY['A ransom note in a kidnapping case demanded payment in bitcoin, but no details about actual harm, loss amount, victim outcome, or attack success are provided in the excerpt.', 'A ransom note in an unspecified kidnapping case demanded millions in bitcoin; no details provided regarding victim harm, resolution, or payment.', 'A ransom note in a kidnapping case demanded payment in bitcoin, but no details are provided regarding victim harm, actual loss, or attack outcome.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'An alleged ransom note demanded up to $6 million in Bitcoin from Nancy Guthrie, indicating a kidnapping or extortion threat with a substantial cryptocurrency payment demand.', 'A kidnapper who tortured an individual known as the ''Crypto King'' is seeking a sentence reduction. The case involves confirmed kidnapping and torture of a cryptocurrency-related victim.', 'A cryptocurrency-related robbery occurred in Bali where the victim was subsequently identified and exposed by an X (Twitter) community, though specific details about the attack method, injuries, or loss amount are not provided in the excerpt.', 'A Bitcoin treasury company conducted a share buyback after selling 177 BTC, resulting in reduced share count but lower Bitcoin value per share; this is a corporate financial transaction with no physical security incident.', 'A cryptocurrency-related robbery occurred in Bali, with the victim subsequently exposed by the X community; specific details regarding harm, loss amount, and attack circumstances are not provided in the excerpt.', 'A CertiK report documents physical attacks on cryptocurrency holders at their homes, with $124M in losses over six months and a 12-fold increase in incidents, with France identified as a primary location.', 'CertiK reported 20 home invasions targeting cryptocurrency holders in the first half of 2026, a significant increase from one incident in the prior year, with France accounting for 33 of 52 verified wrench attacks duri