  ARRAY['Article discusses political implications of a senator''s death on cryptocurrency legislation voting dynamics; no physical security incident or threat to cryptocurrency holders reported.', 'Article discusses President Trump''s advocacy for the CLARITY Act cryptocurrency legislation in the Senate; no physical security incident or threat reported.', 'A Russian man was kidnapped and tortured for 30 hours in Bali in an incident connected to cryptocurrency.', 'A Russian national was kidnapped in Bali and held for approximately 30 hours while being extorted for $5 million in cryptocurrency, representing an organized abduction with significant financial demand and extended captivity.', 'A Russian individual in Bali was kidnapped for 30 hours and coerced to surrender access to a cryptocurrency account.', 'Headline references ''crypto kidnapping'' in Bali but provides no factual details about an actual incident, victims, harm, or confirmed event.', NULL, 'Bali Police are investigating the kidnapping of Russian nationals and theft of cryptocurrency. The incident involves both abduction and financial loss connected to crypto assets.', 'An Oregon business was impacted by ransomware attacks that resulted in $15 million in bitcoin being paid or demanded; this is a cyber-based extortion incident rather than a physical-world cryptocurrency security threat.', 'An individual claiming to have seen Nancy Guthrie in Mexico five days prior demanded bitcoin ransom, suggesting a potential kidnapping or extortion scheme involving cryptocurrency demands.', 'A French couple in Paris was targeted in a home invasion by individuals posing as police, resulting in a stated loss of $1 million in Bitcoin.', 'Union County, Ohio government paid a $1 million Bitcoin ransom to the Kairos cyber extortion group following a data-only cyberattack; this is a digital extortion incident without physical security breach or on-site attack.', 'A kidnapping case in Pakistan has an identified connection to cryptocurrency, though specific details about the victim, perpetrators, demands, or harm are not provided in the excerpt.', 'A game developer in Hong Kong reported being forced to hand over approximately $24 million in cryptocurrency during a violent robbery.', 'A 25-year-old man was assaulted by four men at a hotel in Hun Hom, Hong Kong, and forced to disclose cryptocurrency passwords, resulting in theft of approximately $680,000 in cryptocurrency and 42 kg of silver.', 'A man impersonating a postal worker delivered a letter demanding cryptocurrency to a Seattle homeowner, then forced entry and assaulted both the homeowner and his wife.', 'Pakistani authorities are investigating the abduction and rape of foreign women allegedly connected to a cryptocurrency dispute, indicating serious violent crimes with multiple victims.', NULL, 'In Pakistan, a relative of the Deputy PM allegedly extorted cryptocurrency from foreign women held captive, using death threats as coercion. The incident involved kidnapping, unlawful detention, and violent threats to obtain cryptocurrency.', 'A case involving alleged abduction and sexual assault in Pakistan reportedly centers on a cryptocurrency deal offer connected to the Deputy Prime Minister''s grandson.', 'Article reports allegations against Pakistan''s Deputy PM involving cryptocurrency, sexual assault, and ransom claims, but provides no specific details about physical cryptocurrency security incidents, confirmed losses, or attack details.', 'Article headline claims France is an epicenter for crypto kidnappings, but the excerpt provided contains no specific incident details, victim information, locations, confirmed cases, or factual data to substantiate the claim.', 'A grandson of Pakistan''s Deputy PM was remanded in custody in connection with a cryptocurrency-related hostage extortion case in Lahore involving wallet theft and coercion.', NULL, NULL, 'Two men posing as police kidnapped an 18-year-old cryptocurrency investor and influencer in Ribeirão Preto, São Paulo, Brazil, targeting him specifically because of his cryptocurrency investments.', 'A California man pleaded guilty to harassing the family of a missing woman by sending fake Bitcoin ransom messages; no actual physical attack, kidnapping, or cryptocurrency theft occurred.', 'France reported 77 wrench attacks targeting cryptocurrency holders in the first half of 2026, prompting government commitment to increased enforcement measures.', 'France reported 77 kidnappings in the current year connected to cryptocurrency, indicating organized criminal activity targeting victims for crypto-related extortion or ransom.', 'A suspect associated with the Scattered Spider group was extradited to the US in connection with an $8 million cryptocurrency ransom demand, representing a legal proceeding rather than an active physical attack or confirmed loss.', 'France has experienced a surge in kidnappings targeting cryptocurrency holders, exploiting personal data to identify and coerce victims into transferring digital assets.', 'French authorities report a surge in kidnappings and extortion incidents related to cryptocurrency across the country, according to official data cited in the article.', NULL, NULL, 'Official data indicates a surge in kidnappings and extortion incidents related to cryptocurrency across France, representing organized criminal activity targeting victims for financial gain.', 'A victim in Pecatu, Bali, Indonesia was abducted after leaving work, held captive for 30 hours, and coerced to transfer $5 million USD in cryptocurrency to their captors.', 'France reported 77 kidnapping and extortion cases in 2026 connected to cryptocurrency, indicating organized criminal activity targeting victims for crypto-related ransom or coercion.', 'France reported 77 cryptocurrency-related kidnapping cases in the first half of the year, prompting the Minister of the Interior to pledge strengthened response measures.', 'French authorities reported 77 kidnappings and extortions related to cryptocurrency since January, according to a government minister, indicating organized criminal activity targeting crypto holders.', 'France reported 77 kidnapping and extortion cases in 2026 targeting cryptocurrency holders, indicating organized criminal activity with physical threats and coercion.', 'France reported 77 wrench attacks targeting cryptocurrency holders, prompting strengthened law enforcement response. The attacks involved physical coercion to extract cryptocurrency from victims.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'TMZ founder Harvey Levin claims he offered to pay a Bitcoin ransom in the Nancy Guthrie case and states the FBI instructed him to cease involvement. The incident involves a kidnapping with ransom demand, though no confirmed loss amount or harm to the victim is stated in the excerpt.', 'Three armed men approached a couple in Forest Hills, Queens, New York and demanded their cryptocurrency hardware wallet before fleeing on foot without obtaining it.', 'A tipster demanded one Bitcoin in exchange for video and location information related to the Nancy Guthrie kidnapping case, according to TMZ reporting.', 'An individual demanded Bitcoin ransom in connection with Nancy Guthrie, sending emails with evidence and demands. The incident involves kidnapping or extortion with cryptocurrency ransom demand.', 'An individual claims to possess a video of Nancy Guthrie with kidnappers and demands Bitcoin for its release, representing an alleged kidnapping with extortion demand connected to cryptocurrency.', 'An FBI investigation involves Bitcoin ransom demands related to the Nancy Guthrie search case, indicating a kidnapping or extortion situation with cryptocurrency payment demands.']::text[]
