  ARRAY['A tipster claims to possess video evidence of Nancy Guthrie''s kidnappers and is demanding Bitcoin as payment for the information, indicating an active kidnapping case with cryptocurrency extortion.', 'Nancy Guthrie was kidnapped; a $152 Bitcoin ransom demand was made but an expert assessed it as an unlikely tactic for the perpetrator.', NULL, 'Article references a kidnapping case involving Nancy Guthrie and a $152 cryptocurrency-related error by detectives, but the excerpt provides no details about actual physical harm, confirmed loss, or attack specifics.', 'An FBI test deposit of $152 in Bitcoin during a kidnapping investigation in Arizona may have deterred the kidnappers from proceeding with ransom demands.', 'A home invasion was attempted against a couple in Grivesnes, France, based on the false belief that they held cryptocurrency.', 'Article discusses analysis of ransom notes in an unspecified case involving Nancy Guthrie; no confirmed cryptocurrency connection, physical harm, or loss amount is stated.', 'Article discusses analysis of ransom notes related to Nancy Guthrie case; no specific cryptocurrency-related physical security incident is described in the excerpt provided.', 'TMZ reports that the FBI allegedly ceased communication after a Bitcoin ransom offer was made in the Nancy Guthrie case; no confirmed ransom payment, victim harm, or attack details are stated.', 'TMZ reports that the FBI allegedly ceased communication after a Bitcoin ransom offer was made in connection with the Nancy Guthrie case; no confirmed loss, injury, or attack details are stated.', NULL, 'A former FBI agent speculates that the Nancy Guthrie kidnapping could be connected to cryptocurrency, but no confirmed details about crypto involvement, ransom demands, or attack specifics are provided in the excerpt.', 'A former FBI agent claims a kidnapping involving Nancy Guthrie was connected to cryptocurrency, but no specific details about the incident, victim harm, demands, or confirmed loss are provided in the excerpt.', 'Four individuals were arrested in connection with a kidnapping and robbery incident related to cryptocurrency near Marseille, France. No specific details regarding victims, injuries, or amounts were provided in the excerpt.', 'Nancy Guthrie was kidnapped in an incident classified by a crypto security firm as a ''wrench attack,'' a physical coercion method targeting cryptocurrency holders.', 'Nancy Guthrie was kidnapped in an incident classified by a crypto security firm as a ''wrench attack,'' a physical coercion method targeting cryptocurrency holders.', 'Two Texas brothers pleaded guilty to robbing a Minnesota family of $8 million in cryptocurrency, constituting an organized theft with substantial confirmed financial loss.', NULL, 'Two Texas brothers pleaded guilty to robbing a Minnesota family of $8 million in cryptocurrency, constituting an organized armed robbery with significant confirmed financial loss.', 'Multiple individuals pleaded guilty to kidnapping and robbing a Minnesota family of $8 million in cryptocurrency, representing an organized attack with serious violence and substantial confirmed loss.', 'Two Texas brothers admitted to robbing $8 million in cryptocurrency while holding a family at gunpoint. The perpetrators face up to 20 years in prison for the armed robbery.', 'Two brothers admitted to armed robbery of a Minnesota family''s cryptocurrency accounts. The incident involved weapons and criminal coercion to access digital assets.', 'A Karachi trader reported being abducted and robbed of approximately $500,000 in cryptocurrency, with police registering a case in response to the allegation.', 'A crypto trader reported being kidnapped for a short duration with accompanying data theft, though specific details regarding location, duration, injury, or financial loss are not provided in the excerpt.', 'Two Texas brothers admitted to robbing $8 million in cryptocurrency while holding a family at gunpoint. The armed attack resulted in criminal charges carrying sentences up to 20 years in prison.', 'Two Texas brothers pleaded guilty in connection with an $8 million cryptocurrency heist and kidnapping in Washington County, involving both significant financial loss and abduction.', NULL, NULL, 'Four individuals were arrested in Marseille for an attempted kidnapping connected to cryptocurrency theft, reflecting rising organized crypto crime in France.', 'A cryptocurrency trader in Karachi was kidnapped and tortured, with millions in cryptocurrency reported stolen during the incident.', 'Two brothers were charged in connection with a kidnapping related to an $8 million cryptocurrency extortion scheme in the Minneapolis-St. Paul area.', NULL, 'CertiK reports a 41% increase in wrench attacks (physical coercion for cryptocurrency), citing the Nancy Guthrie case involving a $6M Bitcoin ransom demand as a notable example of this trend.', 'An individual was indicted in France in connection with a ''wrench attack'' targeting cryptocurrency, a physical coercion method used to force victims to surrender digital assets.', 'An individual was indicted in France in connection with a ''wrench attack'' targeting cryptocurrency, a physical coercion method used to force victims to surrender digital assets.', 'An individual was indicted in France in connection with a ''wrench attack'' targeting cryptocurrency, a physical assault method used to coerce victims into surrendering digital assets.', NULL, 'Four individuals attempted a home invasion in the 13th district of Marseille, France. No cryptocurrency connection, harm, or loss is stated in the report.', 'The article reports an increase in kidnapping incidents in Europe connected to cryptocurrency, though specific details about victims, locations, methods, or confirmed cases are not provided in the excerpt.', 'A crypto influencer was kidnapped from his Porsche in Vitória, Brazil, and handed over $3,000 USD to his abductors before escaping; one suspect was arrested.', 'A St. Louis man admitted involvement in a kidnapping plot connected to cryptocurrency, indicating a coordinated criminal scheme targeting victims for financial extortion.', 'A carjacking incident involving a Lamborghini owned by a Bitcoin holder was prosecuted in US court, representing a physical attack targeting a cryptocurrency holder''s asset.', 'A Missouri man entered a plea in connection with a Connecticut cryptocurrency and kidnapping scheme, indicating an organized crime involving both physical abduction and financial crime elements.', NULL, NULL, 'A Missouri man admitted to participating in a 2024 kidnapping and attempted cryptocurrency robbery in Connecticut, involving coordinated criminal activity and deprivation of liberty.', NULL, 'A Missouri man pleaded guilty to involvement in a kidnapping plot targeting a Danbury couple related to a stolen Bitcoin fortune, representing an organized criminal conspiracy involving abduction threats over cryptocurrency assets.', 'An AMU (Aligarh Muslim University) clerk was arrested for extorting approximately 2 crore rupees in cryptocurrency by falsely invoking gangster Lawrence Bishnoi''s name, representing an organized extortion scheme targeting cryptocurrency assets.', 'A California cryptocurrency figure known as ''The Godfather'' pleaded guilty in connection with a kidnapping plot related to a $245 million bitcoin theft.']::text[]
